            "modal_content": "<p>Free Shipping on all orders (within India). Delivery within 10 business days. All orders are shipped with a tracking number.<\/p><h5>Returns<\/h5><p>Returns are accepted only if the product is damaged or broken. Refunds will be processed back to the original payment method.<\/p><h5>Help<\/h5><p>Reach out to us if you have any other questions and\/or concerns.<\/p><p>Email: <a href=\"https:\/\/legxi.co\/products\/reach@legxi.co\">reach@legxi.co<\/a><\/p><p>Phone: +91 9315704239<\/p>",
