        "richtext_NT7QmM": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Each artwork is individually hand-signed by a member of Argentina's World Cup-winning core, including Lionel Messi, Emiliano Martínez, Julián Álvarez, Enzo Fernández, Lautaro Martínez, and Rodrigo De Paul.<\/p><p>Across the complete edition of ten artworks, every signature creates a direct connection between collector and champion.<\/p><p>Officially licensed by the Argentine Football Association and accompanied by a Certificate of Authenticity, Campeónes has been created for collectors seeking rare pieces connected to football's defining moments.<\/p><p>Only ten editions exist worldwide.<\/p>",
            "position": "bottom_left"
